he legal and legitimate backing it require so that both parties will be protected from breach of the law both locally and internationally. Upon receipt of your response, I shall furnish you with the next step to take on how you shall prosecute this claim to your account. The entire transaction should be completed within 10 official working days from the day the bank receives your initial application. When you receive this letter, Kindly send me an e-mailsignifying Your acceptance or otherwise, include your private Telephone numbers for more explanation and confidential communication. Waiting to hear from you soon, Best Regards, K. Oxidize.  PLEASE REPLY TO k_omidire@yahoo.com___________________________________________ Look Good, Feel Good www.healthiest.co.za",d06,Employment and Recruitment,"GENERAL SETTINGS
