act of the Security Company here in Abidjan. I have decided to compensate you with fifteen percent (15%) of the entire funds for your assistance.  Thank you for your anticipated cooperation.  Yours Sincerely, Danuta Annual.  		--------------------------------- Noumea : telephone coins Cher Alec Yahoo! Messenger. Apple Le Monde entire à part de 0,012 /minute ! Téléchargez la version beta.",d14,Technology and IT Services,"GENERAL SETTINGS
