. 1 YOUR FULL NAME 2. YOUR CONTACT (HOME)ADDRESS 3. YOUR TELEPHONE AND FAX NUMBER 4. YOUR DATE OF BIRTH & YOUR OCCUPATION I await your quick answer, and sorry for poor English if there is any. Thank you. James NAND Saving. ",d15,Personal and Family Relationships,"GENERAL SETTINGS
