th this email:(Jessica_haword@sms@.CZ) to enable me direct you to my lawyer. Any delay in your reply will give me room in sourcing another person for this same purpose. Please assure me that you will act accordingly as I stated herein. Hope to receive your reply. Remain blessed. Your Sister, Mrs Jessica Heywood.",d15,Personal and Family Relationships,"GENERAL SETTINGS
